  "privacyIntro": "Your business data belongs to you. QuickBill works offline and keeps it on your phone.",
  "privacyLocalTitle": "Your data stays on your phone",
  "privacyLocalBody": "Invoices, estimates, receipts, clients, items and your business profile are saved only on this phone. There is no account and no QuickBill server, so we never see them.",
  "privacyBackupTitle": "Backups are your files",
  "privacyBackupBody": "A backup is a file you create and choose where to keep, such as Google Drive or email. We never receive it.",
  "privacyAdsTitle": "Ads",
  "privacyAdsBody": "Free users may see ads from Google AdMob. Where the law requires it, you are asked for consent first and can change it later in Settings. Pro users see no ads.",
  "privacyPurchaseTitle": "Purchases",
  "privacyPurchaseBody": "QuickBill Pro is bought and billed through Google Play. We do not see your card or payment details.",
  "privacyAnalyticsTitle": "Usage and crash reports",
  "privacyAnalyticsBody": "Anonymous usage events and crash reports are sent through Google Firebase to help us fix problems. They never include names, amounts, phone numbers, emails or invoice details.",
  "privacyPermissionsTitle": "Photos and contacts",
  "privacyPermissionsBody": "Photos you pick are used only for your logo and signature. When you add a client from your contacts, only the one contact you choose is read.",
  "privacyDeleteTitle": "Deleting your data",
  "privacyDeleteBody": "Delete any invoice, client or item in the app. Uninstalling QuickBill or clearing its data removes everything from this phone.",
  "privacyChangesTitle": "Changes to this policy",
  "privacyChangesBody": "If this policy changes, the new version will be shown here with a new date.",
  "termsIntro": "The simple rules for using QuickBill and QuickBill Pro.",
  "termsUseTitle": "Using QuickBill",
  "termsUseBody": "QuickBill is an app by IRR Dev Labs for making invoices, estimates and receipts. You may use it for your own business.",
  "termsProTitle": "QuickBill Pro",
  "termsProBody": "Pro is an optional subscription, monthly or yearly, billed by Google Play. It unlocks all templates and colors and removes ads.",
  "termsTrialTitle": "Free trial",
  "termsTrialBody": "When Google Play offers a free trial, it becomes a paid plan unless you cancel in Google Play before it ends.",
  "termsCancelTitle": "Cancelling and refunds",
  "termsCancelBody": "Cancel anytime in Google Play. Pro stays on until the period you already paid for ends. Refunds follow Google Play's refund policy.",
