  "supportFaqTitle": "Common questions",
  "supportFaq1Q": "How do I move my data to a new phone?",
  "supportFaq1A": "Open Backup & restore and export a backup file. Save it to Google Drive or send it to yourself. On the new phone, install QuickBill and restore that file.",
  "supportFaq2Q": "I paid for Pro but it is not active",
  "supportFaq2A": "Open the Pro page and tap Restore purchases while signed in to the Google account you paid with.",
  "supportFaq3Q": "How do I cancel Pro?",
  "supportFaq3A": "In Google Play, open Profile › Payments & subscriptions › Subscriptions, choose QuickBill and cancel. Pro stays on until the paid period ends.",
  "supportFaq4Q": "Can I change my invoice numbers?",
  "supportFaq4A": "Yes. Open Settings › Invoice numbers to change the prefix and the next number.",
  "supportFaq5Q": "Is my data uploaded anywhere?",
  "supportFaq5A": "No. Everything stays on your phone unless you share a PDF or export a backup yourself."
